Package: health-check-desktop
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Desktop Checkup contributors
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, smartmontools, policykit-1
Description: Local desktop health checks for Ubuntu and Zorin OS
 Desktop Checkup explains common desktop, software, storage, memory, service,
 log, and drive health findings. It runs locally and does not contact servers.
